msgid "Activity"
msgstr ""

msgid "Every skill Chronoa ran, newest first, from its own tool-call log."
msgstr ""

msgid "Artifacts"
msgstr ""

msgid "Where models, voices, documents and exports are stored. Browse, search, download and clean up your local files."
msgstr ""

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr ""

msgid "Automation"
msgstr ""

msgid "Saved phrases, rules that fire on their own, plans, and the switch that lets any of them run with the window closed."
msgstr ""

msgid "Calendar"
msgstr ""

msgid "What is on your calendars, read from the same Evolution Data Server sources the calendar_events skill and the calendar trigger read. Read-only: nothing here changes an event, and nothing is read while the consent key below is off."
msgstr ""

msgid "Changes"
msgstr ""

msgid "What Chronoa wrote and made: the diff of each change, an editor to open it in, and the files it produced."
msgstr ""

